	(text "FPGA TILE (single-PCB, rev-A frame/topology) -- authoritative schematic. Generated by board/kicad/sch_gen.py; regenerate, do not hand-edit."
		(at 25.4 246.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "060b815b-5517-58f9-8acf-1d2e7110fa71")
	)
	(text "FPGA: Gowin GW1NZ-LV1QN48C6/I5 (QN48 6x6 P0.4). Config: MODE[2:0]='000 AUTO BOOT from embedded flash (UG290); JTAG live on TCK/TMS/TDI/TDO test pads; 26 tile IO per production cst; unused pads 6/9/14/15/29 (pin 9 = UG842/UG846 order-code hazard)."
		(at 25.4 256.54 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "dfdb36ff-3012-5d34-b567-bfc6c141bae7")
	)
	(text "Rails: VCC 3.3 V from chassis (JP_VCC power_out feeds the tile); VCC1V2 1.2 V locally regulated by U2=TI TLV75512PDBVR (SBVS320D: CIN>=1u C9, COUT>=1u C8 BEFORE bead FB1; core caps C4/C5/C6 sit on the filtered side). Accuracy 1.188-1.212 V within 1.07-1.26 V spec."
		(at 25.4 266.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e0b7591c-a958-5fe8-bca2-5a51d56dfb31")
	)
	(text "Presence: JP_GND_DET_T/B/R are BONDED to tile GND (inserted = hard ground on the contact, removed = open); the backplane keeps the three detect traces separate (connector-next owns them)."
		(at 25.4 276.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "26f3701e-d270-598d-b4d6-10fa1ce33a41")
	)
	(text "Outputs: R7..R11 (0402, 0R populated) are frame-neutral series-termination positions on T_clk/L_clk/L_latch/B_data/B_W (U1-<net>_DRV--Rn--<net>-JP). Value chosen after bench B2; the free edge knob is the RTL DRIVE attribute (OSS-proven: cst attrs are ignored, RTL attrs reach the bitstream). See docs/termination.md."
		(at 25.4 287.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "453da65a-88b1-5df8-9e30-3fa0ca387c0a")
	)
